05/09", weight="87", tooltip="NEIRA Boys & Girls Fours,MIddlesex v Choate			
Distance: 1500m Conditions: G6, G7, B5 races were 1250m..Conditions were varied, started with head wind for first 5 races then flat no wind for B4, G5, B2 and then head wind for first half of course and heavy rain for G1 & 2 
B4 boat results can not be used for seeding purposes as Choate went outside two buoys Comments: 
Race order G6-G4-B3-G7-B5-G3-B4-G5-B2-B1-G2- G1
Race order was to allow hot seating hulls, a G3 rower needed to Hotseat into G2 due to illness and a g5 rower hotseated into G4 for injury. G1 was delayed by 2 races as a seat broke in the warmup G5 had a restart due to crash a few strokes in. G7 MX was open water ahead with 400m remaining and had a boat-turnng-over-the-head crab
B4 boat results can not be used for seeding purposes as Choate went outside two buoys
Great day of racing and thanks to Choate for traveling here and having 12 races!
